OL,4,CFirst Children's Booker prize reveals  
OL,5,Cshortlist - and its child judges       
OL,6,GThe first ever Children's Booker Prize 
OL,7,Ghas announced the eight books in the   
OL,8,Grunning for the new #50,000 award.     
OL,10,FFive novels, two graphic novels and an 
OL,11,Fillustrated collection of short        
OL,12,Fstories are on the shortlist, which is 
OL,13,Faimed at children aged eight to 12.    
OL,15,FThe authors in contention include      
OL,16,Fformer Children's Laureate of Ireland  
OL,17,FEoin Colfer, who is best known for his 
OL,18,FArtemis Fowl series, and teacher and   
OL,19,Fchildren's author Catherine Bruton.    
